# Summary

The statute specifies that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute [[cite:obs-b81d9de0a12c2c4e84174f0c1caf3e7d70dfda17 "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]]. According to the schedule, ledgers are kept for eleven calendar years, after which they are shredded [[cite:obs-3a12814f5fb94d396cfb79998b461d877a339dc1 "Ledgers: eleven calendar years, shredding afterwards."]].
